If you have the maximum carrying capacity of 1000, you can
carry the following weights at the following encumbrance levels:

Unencumbered :    0 - 1000
Burdened     : 1001 - 1499
Stressed     : 1500 - 1999
Strained     : 2000 - 2499
Overtaxed    : 2500 - 2999

Anything further than that would put you at Overloaded, which you can't
enter voluntarily. For the upper boundary of Overtaxed to have been
between 2500 and 2550, I think your carrying capacity must have been
850; that is, average of CON and (mapped) STR being 16 or 16.5.

